{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33028","headline":"姑苏台 · 曹邺","name":"姑苏台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南宫酒未销，又宴姑苏台。\n美人和泪去，半夜阊门开。\n相对正歌舞，笑中闻鼓鼙。\n星散九重门，血流十二街。\n一去成万古，台尽人不回。\n时闻野田中，拾得黄金钗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33028.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33028","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}